  "_g_learn_attribution_note": "Corrected 2026-08-28. G_LEARN.produces listed three artifacts it does not write, so it reported PARTIAL every cycle for a reason that was false in three cases out of five. Verified writers: memory/axis_history.json <- memory/trend_tracker.py:80, called at step trend_tracker (index 3, B_SENSE); memory/development_journal.json <- execute_patches.py, step 19 (F_SELF); memory/runtime_experiences.json <- self_observer, step 17 (E_PROPOSE). feedback_log.json and goal_score_history.json stay in G_LEARN: both are written by agents/core/feedback_loop.py at step 20, which is G_LEARN's. A phase that cannot report DONE stops being read, and the one real failure in that list — runtime_experiences.json, unchanged since 2026-08-17 — was hidden behind two false ones."
}
